# Documentation

## Package

### Installation

Add package to the two files manually, the following adding the local package
name ``@core/lite-ui`` to the project.

- Add it to ``package.json`` file

```json
"depedencies": {
  "@core/lite-ui": "^1.0.0",
}
```

- Add it to ``tsconfig.json`` file

```json
"references": [
  { "path": "../../packages/lite-ui" }
]
```


